                </p>
              </td>
              <td>
                <p>676</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>מ-<quantity eId="qty_32" refersTo="#position" normalized="0.5">0.5 משרה</quantity> ומעלה</p>
              </td>
